{
  "_comment": "OpenDPD 公开测量数据下载源。 每个数据集 = 6 个 CSV + 1 个 spec.json。",
  "_repo": "https://github.com/lab-emi/OpenDPD",
  "_branch": "main",
  "base_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/lab-emi/OpenDPD/main/datasets",
  "files_per_dataset": [
    "spec.json",
    "train_input.csv", "train_output.csv",
    "val_input.csv",   "val_output.csv",
    "test_input.csv",  "test_output.csv"
  ],
  "datasets": [
    {"name": "DPA_200MHz"},
    {"name": "DPA_160MHz"},
    {"name": "APA_200MHz"}
  ],
  "_notes": [
    "下载后会自动把 6 个 CSV 拼成 1 个 <name>.npz,字段 = x, y, train_end, val_end",
    "DPA_200MHz 通常 ~50-80 MB,网络慢时可能需要几分钟",
    "失败时实验五会自动回退到合成代理 PA"
  ]
}
